<Placemark>
	<name>Old Dea Airstrip 2026-10-24 07:40:44</name>
	<description><![CDATA[<!-- desc_gen:start -->
<font color="black"><table width="100%"><tr><td width="100%" align="center"><a href="files/1000057581.jpg" target="_blank"><img src="files/1000057581.jpg" width="60px" align="right" style="border: 3px white solid;"></a><br /><br /><a href="files/1000057582.jpg" target="_blank"><img src="files/1000057582.jpg" width="60px" align="right" style="border: 3px white solid;"></a><br /><br />
<!-- desc_user:start -->
The current location of Dea Primary School was formerly the old Dea airstrip. It became unusable due to excessive mud and a short runway, and no other flights landed after it was initially cleared.<br />The original Dea School was established at Taparuraha, located between Dea, Ugunomo, and Siribu villages. When the airstrip became non-operational, the school was relocated to the airstrip site as it needed an area accessible to the main road.
<!-- desc_user:end -->
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1"><hr></td></tr><tr><td><table width="100%"><tr><td align="left" valign="center"><small><b>Altitude</b></small></td><td align="center" valign="center">927 m</td></tr>
